                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Census profile uses 2016 data.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "12px",
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "color": "#6F4700"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "\n• Age structure is a proxy, not socioeconomic or clinical need.\n• GNR measures uncertainty, not disadvantage.\n• ODHF locations do not measure capacity, staffing, hours, ownership, utilization, access, quality or outcomes.\n• Missing coordinates and unmodeled cross-boundary flows affect interpretation.\n• Rankings depend on assumed weights.\n• Allocations are hypothetical—not VCH resources or recommendations.\n• The model does not establish causal demand or unmet need.\n\nBefore operational use: add capacity, staffing, utilization, waits, patient flows, accessibility, service scope, outcomes, current population data and stakeholder/clinical validation.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "11px",
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "color": "#6F4700"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              }
            ]
